@startuml
title Layers of control around an AI agent

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "8. Cloud guardrails\nrights, deletion protection, budget (document 06-06)" as L8 #F4F7F9 {
  rectangle "7. Repository and pipeline\nprotected main branch, gates, review by a person" as L7 #E3F2FD {
    rectangle "6. Identity\nno credential that can change the cloud" as L6 #E3F2FD {
      rectangle "5. Hooks\na program decides before a tool runs" as L5 #C8E6C9 {
        rectangle "4. Permission rules\nallowed, asked, never" as L4 #C8E6C9 {
          rectangle "3. Sandbox\nfiles and network of every command" as L3 #C8E6C9 {
            rectangle "2. Managed settings\nthe company's policy, not overridable" as L2 #FFF8E1 {
              rectangle "1. Data path and terms\nwhat leaves the workstation" as L1 #FFF8E1 {
                component "Agent\n(model + tools)" as A #FFFFFF
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

note bottom of L8
  Layers 1 to 5 are on the workstation: the harness itself.
  Layers 6 to 8 hold even if the harness is misconfigured
  or bypassed: the agent has nothing to do damage with.
end note
@enduml
